| `server/routes/audit.ts` | 100% SQLite, zero Supabase | ❌ Precisa corrigir |
| `server/routes/directories.ts` | 100% SQLite, zero Supabase | ❌ Precisa corrigir |
| `server/routes/relatorios.ts` | 100% SQLite, zero Supabase | ❌ Precisa corrigir |
| `server/routes/upload.ts` | SQLite + `fileStorage.ts` (fs local) | ❌ Precisa corrigir |
